abstract: >-
  Executable illustration of the Expectation-Decision-Observation (P/R/O)
  reconciliation model for cross-platform agent assets: five invariants,
  canonical-split and machine-contract assurance checks, a manifest-and-hash
  baseline, and eight synthetic cases.
